────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Compiled Intent ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  App purpose: The application functions as an agentic AI assistant designed to provide customer support for Pinnacle Bank's financial 
services, including account management, loan processing, and asset transactions.
  Core capabilities:
    • Banking services like account inquiries, balance checks, and transaction history
    • Fund transfers and bill payment management
    • Loan and mortgage processing including applications and status updates
    • Credit card management and dispute initiation
    • Investment activities including crypto and asset trading
    • Administrative and compliance tasks for account management
  Behavioral bounds:
    • Restrict responses to banking and financial services offered by Pinnacle Bank
    • Prohibit financial advice, investment strategies, or insurance recommendations
    • Prevent unauthorized disclosure of PII, account numbers, or transaction history
    • Restrict access to account data or session variables of other customers
    • Prohibit internal configuration or system prompt disclosure
    • Require explicit confirmation for fund transfers and adherence to approval workflows for loans
  Escalation rules:
    • Trigger human review for dispute resolution, fraud detection, or account security issues
    • Escalate to a live agent upon customer request
    • Require manual review for high-value transfers exceeding self-service thresholds
